From 23e62bb86e96b4aa855687a41c03255f26e540d3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: airidosas252 <airidaslideikis@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 08:32:48 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 15/20] freedreno/common: Use a full sysmem depth CCU cache on
 X2-90

X2-90 inherits the a8xx_gen2 sysmem depth CCU setting, DEPTH_CACHE_SIZE
THREE_QUARTER with 192KB per CCU. With it, sysmem render passes that
write UBWC depth and stencil can deadlock the GPU. Cyberpunk 2077 under
vkd3d-proton hangs within minutes (CP BR status 0x00fc1346, followed by
a hangcheck recovery loop) and shows blocky corruption before that.

A captured submit reproduces the hang every time when replayed. It
reduces to two draws in a depth-only sysmem pass: a discarding fragment
shader, D32_SFLOAT UBWC depth with separate stencil, depth test and
write, and stencil REPLACE. Changing only RB_CCU_CACHE_CNTL in the
replay:
- DEPTH_CACHE_SIZE 3 hangs at every depth and color cache offset
  tried, including layouts with extra space between the two caches;
- FULL, HALF and QUARTER do not hang.

Programming the A840 values of RB_CCU_CNTL, RB_CCU_DBG_ECO_CNTL and
RB_RBP_CNTL from the kernel does not avoid the hang either.

Use the full 256KB per CCU depth cache from gen1, which is also the
gen2 GMEM depth setting. With 21MB of GMEM and 8 CCUs the sysmem
caches still fit, and the depth cache moves from 0x10c0000 to
0x1040000. This fixes the hangs and the corruption in the game.

X2-85 also uses a8xx_gen2 but was not tested, so it is left unchanged.

Fixes: 6e3598177b8 ("freedreno/common: Add A840 and X2-85")
---
 src/freedreno/common/freedreno_devices.py | 7 ++++++-
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/freedreno/common/freedreno_devices.py b/src/freedreno/common/freedreno_devices.py
index 7320f6cae01..2cbb1503726 100644
--- a/src/freedreno/common/freedreno_devices.py
+++ b/src/freedreno/common/freedreno_devices.py
@@ -1616,7 +1616,12 @@ add_gpus([
         GPUId(chip_id=0xffff44070041, name="Adreno (TM) X2-90"),
     ], A6xxGPUInfo(
         CHIP.A8XX,
-        [a7xx_base, a7xx_gen3, a8xx_base, a8xx_gen2, a8xx_vpc_cache_lg],
+        [a7xx_base, a7xx_gen3, a8xx_base, a8xx_gen2, a8xx_vpc_cache_lg,
+         # A THREE_QUARTER sysmem depth cache can hang the GPU on X2-90
+         GPUProps(
+            sysmem_ccu_depth_cache_fraction = CCUColorCacheFraction.FULL.value,
+            sysmem_per_ccu_depth_cache_size = 256 * 1024,
+         )],
         num_ccu = 8,
         num_slices = 4,
         tile_align_w = 64,
-- 
